tribute is required for an anchor to be keyboard accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide an href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/evcohen/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/master/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","JSXOpeningElement","no-unused-vars","'kamala' is defined but never used.","Identifier","unusedVar","jsx-a11y/iframe-has-title","<iframe> elements must have a unique title property.","jsx-a11y/alt-text","img elements must have an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","no-useless-escape","Unnecessary escape character: \\[.","Literal","unnecessaryEscape",["261","262"],"Unnecessary escape character: \\..",["263","264"],"Unnecessary escape character: \\\".",["265","266"],["267","268"],["269","270"],["271","272"],["273","274"],["275","276"],["277","278"],["279","280"],["281","282"],["283","284"],"'gender' is assigned a value but never used.","'Link' is defined but never used.","'Sponsor1' is defined but never used.","'Sponsor2' is defined but never used.","'Sponsor3' is defined but never used.",["285","286"],["287","288"],["289","290"],["291","292"],["293","294"],["295","296"],["297","298"],["299","300"],["301","302"],["303","304"],["305","306"],["307","308"],"no-native-reassign",["309"],"no-negated-in-lhs",["310"],"'undergraduate' is defined but never used.","react-hooks/exhaustive-deps","React Hook useEffect contains a call to 'setFixed'. Without a list of dependencies, this can lead to an infinite chain of updates. To fix this, pass [] as a second argument to the useEffect Hook.",["311"],"react/jsx-no-target-blank","Using target=\"_blank\" without rel=\"noreferrer\" is a security risk: see https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#link-type-noopener","JSXAttribute","'Kamala' is defined but never used.","'PrimaryBtn' is defined but never used.","'Linkedn' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook React.useEffect has a missing dependency: 'props.location.search'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.","ArrayExpression",["312"],["313"],"'subject' is assigned a value but never used.","'setSubject' is assigned a value but never used.","'institution' is assigned a value but never used.","'course' is assigned a value but never used.","'setCourse' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'availability'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["314"],{"messageId":"315","fix":"316","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"319","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"321","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"322","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"323","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"324","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"325","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"326","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"327","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"328","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"329","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"330","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"331","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"332","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"333","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"334","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"335","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"336","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"337","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"338","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"339","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"340","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"341","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"342","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"343","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"344","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"345","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"346","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"347","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"348","desc":"320"},{"messageId":"315","fix":"349","desc":"317"},{"messageId":"318","fix":"350","desc":"320"},{"messa